    "rewrite": "Choosing the appropriate technology was crucial for Caterham in aligning costs with benefits while ensuring data is effectively managed during transit."
   },
   "12": {
    "original": "For the current Formula One season the cloud-based, server-based provisioning of Live Timing is delivered by Aeris and is provided across every device, both smartphones and tablets.",
    "rewrite": "During the ongoing Formula One season, Aeris offers cloud and server-based Live Timing services accessible on all devices, including smartphones and tablets."
   },
   "8": {
    "original": "One possible use of the Truphone service is for locating Caterham\u2019s F1 drivers, which Abiteboul estimates has saved him around \u00a31m.",
    "rewrite": "One potential application of the Truphone service is to track Caterham\u2019s F1 racers, with Abiteboul calculating that it could be worth approximately \u00a31m to him."
   },
